EFD includes modified code derived from:
- FreqFormer: https://github.com/JPWang-CS/FreqFormer
- BasicSR: https://github.com/XPixelGroup/BasicSR
The upstream Apache-2.0 license is retained in LICENSE.
This release contains the EFD network and its training/inference support.
Changes include EFD naming, portable configurations, checkpoint bookkeeping-key
handling, side-effect-free network logging, CPU resume support, and release tools.
Upstream authorship and existing copyright notices are retained.
